  "Page People and sign-in, its own entry in the navigation: sign-in, Google and Microsoft, where people come from, admitted groups and every administrator with their scope": "",
  "Who may use this mail server, where they come from, how they sign in, and who administers what.": "",
  "Sign-in": "",
  "How the server knows who someone is. These settings hold for the web app and for mail programs on a phone or laptop. With single sign-on a mailbox has no password of its own: it is reset in the workspace.": "",
  "Sign in to mail protocols through a single sign-on provider": "",
  "People sign in with the same account as for the rest of the workspace, also from a mail program. Passwords are never stored on the mail server.": "",
