  "Northwind workspace (OpenID Connect)": "",
  "OpenID Connect is the standard the workspace sign-in speaks. The mail server asks it whether a sign-in is good, the same way the workspace does.": "",
  "Let a trusted front proxy name the signed-in person": "",
  "The proxy in front of the mail server has already checked who the person is and passes the name along in a request header. Only requests from the trusted address are believed.": "",
